# Deliberate "this model id serves a different family" declarations for audit-pins.sh --probe.
#
# Format:  <group id> <member id> -> <substring the served model must contain>
# Copy to ~/.config/magpie/audit-pins.exceptions and keep only what is true on that machine.
# Without a line here, a member whose served model differs from its id is a FAIL.

# AutoClaw's "auto" router is not GLM despite the autoclaw/ prefix: it answers as
# deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp, which is why it is kept as a DeepSeek fallback in se-coder.
group/se-coder autoclaw/zai_auto -> deepseek
